WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.900
Yugi Muto assembled the Millennium Puzzle and became the guardian of the Shadow Games.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.260
Pegasus has a Millennium Item of his own - the Millennium Eye.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.800
Yugi accepts Pegasus's challenge and goes to Duelist Kingdom.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.940
Pegasus stole his grandfather Sugoroku's soul, and Yugi intends to rescue him.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.940
He battles alongside his trusted friends and with his other self.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:44.300
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:51.210
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.960
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.660
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.760
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.130
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:20.060
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.310
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:33.580
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.320
What is truly precious?

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:03.100
It's not like me to reminisce about the past.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.420
I feel like I've had the longest dream.

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:18.770
Yeah.  With a scary dark version of Bakura.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.940
Come to think of it, weren't there also two Yugis?

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:27.090
Was it really just a dream?

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:32.060
That sounded like...

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:38.070
Pitch Black Duel!
Castle of Dark Illusions

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:48.150
My Harpies were all destroyed.

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:00.900
Rules are rules.  Hand over all your Star Chips.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:03.600
You're eliminated.  Leave!

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.900
Mai!

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.000
Yugi!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.550
Mai.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.750
Are you okay?  What happened?

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.700
Thanks for making it easy.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.920
The prey has come to me.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.350
Who's that big guy?

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:35.080
Be careful!  He's a Player Killer who roams the island and takes Star Chips from duelists!

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.000
Player Killer?

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.200
Yugi.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.720
I'll eliminate you, just like her.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.400
Battle me.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.650
Eliminated?  No way!

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:47.100
Mai.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.680
Yugi, it's over for me.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:54.150
My dream of dueling you won't come true.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.030
Mai.

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:59.150
Listen to this loser whine.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:01.800
How dare you!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:02.650
Jonouchi!

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.650
Let me go!  I'll pummel that creep!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:08.800
Stop.  Violence won't accomplish anything.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:09.900
Still...

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.350
It can't be helped.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:13.870
Mai.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:16.900
Bakura is right, Jonouchi.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.850
Leave this to me.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.850
Yugi.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.000
Yugi.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.650
Don't worry, Mai.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:45.750
I'll defeat this giant and get your Star Chips back.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:59.350
Player Killers are currently hunting duelists on this island.

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:04.450
Yugi Muto, defeating you is our highest priority.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.800
I can't believe my luck.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:11.770
I knew something was up when that Kaiba impersonator appeared.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:15.290
I'm sick of Pegasus's cheap tactics.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:19.450
You fool.  These are Industrial Illusions's orders.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:22.750
Pegasus doesn't give out individual assignments.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:28.970
We'd never bother the great Pegasus with someone so unimportant.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.650
It's all over for you.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:34.180
I'll send those words right back at you.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:38.400
I won't lose.  I will defeat Pegasus.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:43.050
You act tough, but you won't be able to beat me.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:45.900
Not when I have the shadows on my side.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.830
Shadows?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.800
Be careful, Yugi!

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:58.000
When darkness descends on this island, that doesn't mean the duelists can rest.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.650
If you lower your guard, the shadows will attack mercilessly.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:06.300
And you'll lose pathetically, just like that girl.

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:13.000
Listen carefully, big guy.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:18.100
Only cowardly thieves attack people in the dark.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.260
What did you say, you punk?

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:26.050
I'll show you what happens you harm a duelist's honor!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:31.800
I wager all six Star Chips on this duel.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:32.870
Whatever!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:36.100
I took eight Star Chips from her.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.300
I wager them all.

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.200
What?

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:43.320
You'll make up for the remaining two with this.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:50.650
What?

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.450
Yugi!

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.500
Now we're even.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:04.650
When you lose this duel, flames will attack you from the shadows of hell.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.400
This isn't fair!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:09.050
I didn't know about those devices.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:10.750
Yugi.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:19.550
My aim was slightly off on purpose.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:22.850
I can destroy you anytime I want.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.550
Don't even think of running away.

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:27.450
This is crazy!

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:29.000
You must be joking!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.300
Yugi, you don't have to accept his terms!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.870
That's right!  Don't do it, Yugi!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.000
This doesn't count as a duel!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.970
Fine, I accept.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.650
Yugi!

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:46.250
I will defeat you and fix your twisted heart.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:50.750
Save your speeches until you win.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.400
Here I go, Yugi.

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.700
Duel!

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:56.520
Yugi...

00:07:56.520 --> 00:08:03.300
Forget about me.  Defeat him with your own honor as a duelist.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:07.150
I'll show you how dangerous the shadows are.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.000
Here's my card.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.500
Castle of Dark Illusions.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.650
The Yami Field Power Source powers it up.

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:26.250
What's this?

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:30.420
The shadows are coming.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:32.300
What?

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:36.500
This card creates shadows.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.750
What will you do now?

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:46.200
I can't see his cards or his monsters.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:51.200
What a view.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:57.400
I can see you clearly, but you can't see anything.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.750
Be careful, Yugi.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.350
The shadows also defeated my Harpies.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.850
What?

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:14.000
Yugi, Field Power Sources don't work at night, but that doesn't apply to my Dark monsters.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:17.950
It's your turn.  Play your card.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.450
The shadows will bury your card.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:25.470
Due to the shadows, I don't know what he's planning.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:28.550
I play Celtic Guardian in defense position.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.600
I play this card.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:35.280
Attack!

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:37.300
What did he play?

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:42.550
Dark Absolute.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:56.500
Celtic Guardian is destroyed.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.250
Yugi.

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:01.200
Damn!  That attack wasn't fair!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:04.350
We all have to believe in Yugi.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:05.400
But...

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.550
That's all we can do.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:11.100
You are helpless against me.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:18.100
I must destroy Castle of Dark Illusions to get rid of the shadows.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:21.850
But that Castle has over 2500 defense points.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:24.950
It's an invulnerable floating castle.

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:28.100
I don't have any cards in my hand to bring it down.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.210
Damn!  What can I do?

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:33.050
It's your turn.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:36.250
There must be some way.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:40.750
I play Winged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress #1 in defense position.

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:51.950
I won't attack this turn, but I play another monster hidden in the shadows.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:55.650
Another monster hiding in the shadows.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:58.000
I now have more unknown enemies.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:05.700
Yugi, you're like helpless prey lost in the shadows of the night.

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:12.550
The hunters that walk the shadows have set their sights on you.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.600
Mai, can't he do anything?

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:21.200
If I knew how, I wouldn't have lost.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:51.590
I see.  If they're hiding in the shadows, I have to illuminate them.

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:53.960
All right, it's all or nothing.

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:57.200
Winged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress #1, attack!

00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:59.930
Fireball Stone!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.100
I saw them.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:14.220
Too bad.  Even if you attack the shadows, you can't defeat my monsters.

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:17.450
Dark Absolute!

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:28.400
Winged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress #1 is destroyed.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:42.160
I can't target monsters that are hiding in the shadows.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:47.150
Even if I make them temporarily visible with an attack...

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:52.750
...the shadows cover them up immediately, so I can't identify them.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.900
Do you get it, Yugi?

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:57.890
These shadows make me invincible.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:13:04.100
You're wrong!  You're just a coward that can't do anything unless you're hiding in the shadows!

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.400
Yugi!

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:14.350
You should keep your mouth shut.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:18.850
Don't you understand how much danger you're in?

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:25.150
Whether you live or die depends on me and the outcome of this duel.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.830
What's so funny?

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.060
I see.  I now understand.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:37.200
Understand what?

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:42.000
Your twisted heart showed me how to get out of this situation.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.050
Shut your mouth!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:47.340
When the sun rises in the morning, the shadows always disappear.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:51.190
At that time, no one will help you.

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:52.380
In other words...

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:59.650
In the end, I'll be able to see a pitiful dog who lost the game.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.400
How dare you say that!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.450
I found a way to defeat the shadows.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:05.820
What?

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:08.050
This is my trump card.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:11.350
You only have five turns left.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.670
Impossible!

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:17.100
Prepare yourself.  I'll show you that you know nothing about true darkness.

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:20.350
What is he planning to do?

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:25.480
I don't know, but he's confident.  He's not bluffing.

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:29.150
True darkness?

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.300
Don't make me laugh!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.520
By the way you're acting, it's clear that you're backed into a corner.

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:38.150
The shadows are on my side.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:41.500
No matter what you try, you can't win.

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:47.480
A duelist doesn't give up just because the opponent declares victory.

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:48.850
What?

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:54.450
I believe you have pride as a duelist, even though it's very tiny.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:15:01.080
So I'll tell you what my trump card is.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.510
What?

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:05.400
What is he talking about?

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:12.800
My card is Swords of Revealing Light.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.160
Swords of Revealing Light?

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:21.970
These sacred swords of light prevent your monsters from attacking for three turns.

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:28.910
Your monsters may be hiding, but the swords emit sacred light that dispel the shadows.

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:39.250
Light will shine on your monsters and make them immobile, and my cards will destroy them.

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:45.450
Ridiculous.  That weak card can't defeat my shadows.

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.960
We'll find out in five turns.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.960
It's my turn.

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:53.310
I play Curse of Dragon in defense position.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:57.510
Next...

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.210
I set one card on the field.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.650
I end my turn.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:11.710
That set card must be Swords of Revealing Light.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:14.000
I'll say it one more time.

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:16.100
You have five turns left.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.930
How dare he mock me!

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:23.450
Mai, was it okay to reveal his own card?

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:28.980
Can it be?

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:36.910
To fight against the shadows in this duel, Yugi may plan to use a weapon other than cards.

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:39.860
A weapon other than cards?  What could that be?

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:41.910
Probably words.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:43.130
Words?

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.450
Exactly.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:52.290
As long as the Player Killer is hiding in the shadows, Yugi can't see or attack him.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:56.090
But there's one thing that will reach him.

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:58.560
His voice.  His words.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.270
I see.

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:04.030
Yugi is using words as a weapon.

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:07.430
That's his real trump card to fight against the shadows.

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:10.810
Yugi, show me how you battle.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:24.130
Yugi, I've never met a duelist that's foolish enough to reveal his own hand.

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:28.030
I'll make you regret how foolish that was!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:34.710
This card will send your trump card to hell!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:38.180
Reaper of the Cards!

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:41.170
Reaper of the Cards?

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:45.130
This card destroys the spell card that's set on the field.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:51.350
Reaper of the Cards, destroy his Swords of Revealing Light.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.930
Yugi!

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:56.860
That's his trump card!

00:17:56.860 --> 00:18:01.180
If it's destroyed, Yugi can't illuminate the shadows!

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:08.300
Kid, it's all over.

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:12.180
Go to hell!  Card Eraser!

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:22.380
The sickle stopped.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:25.100
I can't attack?

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.110
What's going on?

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:33.410
What's so funny?

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.730
What did you do?

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:40.330
I did say that Swords of Revealing Light was my trump card.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:44.360
But I never said that I placed it on the field.

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:46.050
What?

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:53.110
I set the trap card Spellbinding Circle.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:59.720
Since your Reaper attacked this card, it's caught in my trap.

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:11.850
When I play spell cards, I have to be most careful about Reaper of the Cards.

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:15.850
I knew you'd have this card in your deck.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:18.470
And I sealed it away.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:22.140
Now I don't have to worry about placing spell cards on the field.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.110
You did it!

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:25.600
Awesome!  That's why you're Yugi!

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:29.730
He can make calm decisions even under dire circumstances.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:32.710
But he can't let his guard down yet.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:37.290
How dare you!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:39.830
How dare you trick me!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:44.300
Too bad.  You wasted your turn.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:46.400
Now it's my turn.

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:50.780
I'll set my trump card on the field.

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:57.250
And I set one more spell card.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.850
You set two spell cards on the field?

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:05.000
What?

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.640
Another card.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.910
Which card is it?

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:36.620
Yugi uses words to fight back against Player Killer's unfair attacks.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:39.930
But there are flamethrowers by Yugi's feet!

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:42.630
It's dangerous to keep provoking him!

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:46.590
Swords of Revealing Light clears the shadows, illuminating the opponent's monsters.

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:52.130
Now, Yugi!  Break down his impenetrable guard before it's covered in shadows again!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:56.000
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Cut Through the Darkness!
Swords of Revealing Light

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:58.050
Duel, standby!

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:10.060
The flask glistens

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:17.910
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:26.880
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:34.650
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:40.480
Shower of happiness

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:44.600
I will shower you with it

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:52.880
I will support your lonely back

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:57.110
Shower of happiness

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:01.240
You are not alone

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:07.960
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
